          <td style="padding:26px 26px 8px;">
            <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;color:#0f2438;font-weight:700;">Sisa cuti 2026 akan berakhir</h1>

  <div style="margin:0 0 12px;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#e6f6f3;color:#0f766e;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px;">H-63</span>
  </div>

<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13.2px;line-height:1.65;color:#334960;">Halo Agus,</p>

  <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13.2px;line-height:1.65;color:#334960;">Tahun 2026 tersisa 63 hari. Anda masih memiliki total 109,0 hari cuti yang belum terpakai.</p>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;background:#f6fafc;border:1px solid #e2ecf3;border-radius:10px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;">
                  <div style="font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.7;color:#42586e;">
