          </div>
                  <div style="font-size:12.4px;line-height:1.7;color:#42586e;">
            <span style="color:#0d9488;font-weight:700;">&bull;</span>
            <span style="padding-left:4px;">Cuti Tahunan: sisa 12,0 hari (jatah 12,0 + carry 0,0 − terpakai 0,0)</span>
          </div>
